{"code":"06.0161","total":37,"cells":5,"forms":{"Lat.00":{"n":30,"e":[["darshana/vedanta/dvaita/DvaitaVedanta/itihasa_prasthana/mahabharata_tatparya_nirnaya/tika_chatti","DV_14124","मृशति","…ीला सा जगतीपतेः ।\nअघ्राण्यनेकरूपाणि यदरातिषु मृशति ।। मनसैव जगत्सृष्टं संहारं च करोति यः । तस्य…","महाभारततात्पर्यनिर्णयः — tika_chatti"],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_01/mula","1.1.2.10","मृशति","(ᳮ) स धु᳘रमभि᳘मृशति॥  \nधू᳘रसि धू᳘र्व धू᳘र्वन्तं धू᳘र्व तं᳘ योऽस्…",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_01/mula","1.1.2.20","मृशति","(त्वा᳘था) अ᳘थाभि᳘मृशति॥  \nभूता᳘य त्वा ना᳘रातयऽ इ᳘ति तद्य᳘त ऽएव᳘ गृह…",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_01/mula","1.2.2.11","मृशति","(त्त᳘) त᳘मद्भि᳘रभि᳘मृशति॥  \nसकृद्वा त्रि᳘र्व्वा तद्य᳘दे᳘वास्या᳘त्रावघ…",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_01/mula","1.2.2.12","मृशति","सो ऽभि᳘मृशति॥  \n(त्य) अग्नि᳘ष्टे त्व᳘चं मा᳘ हिᳫँ᳭ सीदि᳘त्…",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_01/mula","1.2.2.14","मृशति","…त᳘दाह यदा᳘ह व्व᳘र्षिष्ठे ऽधिना᳘क ऽइ᳘ति त᳘मभि᳘मृशति शृतं᳘ व्वेदानी᳘ति त᳘स्माद्वा᳘ ऽअभि᳘मृशति॥",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_01/mula","1.2.2.15","मृशति","सो ऽभि᳘मृशति॥  \nमा᳘ भेर्मा सं᳘व्विक्था इ᳘ति मा त्वं᳘ भैषी…",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_01/mula","1.3.3.17","मृशति","स᳘ स्कन्न᳘मभि᳘मृशति॥  \nभु᳘वपतये स्वा᳘हा भु᳘वनपतये स्वा᳘हा भूता᳘न…",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_01/mula","1.3.4.16","मृशति","सो ऽभि᳘मृशति॥  \nध्रुवा᳘ ऽअसदन्नि᳘ति ध्रुवा ह्यसदन्नृत᳘स्य…",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_02/mula","2.3.4.27","मृशति","(त्य᳘) अ᳘थ गा᳘मभि᳘मृशति॥  \nसᳫँ᳭ हि᳘तासि व्विश्वरूपी᳘ति व्विश्व᳘रूपा…",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_02/mula","2.3.4.34","मृशति","…ह्य᳘दित ऽएहीती᳘डा हि गौर᳘दितिर्हि गौस्ता᳘मभि᳘मृशति का᳘म्या ऽएते᳘ति मनु᳘ष्याणा᳘ᳫं᳘ ह्ये᳘तासु का᳘…",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_02/mula","2.6.1.17","मृशति","…डा᳘शम᳘थ धाना ऽअ᳘थ मन्थ᳘मासा᳘द्य हवी᳘ᳫं᳘षि सं᳘मृशति॥",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_03/mula","3.3.2.7","मृशति","सो ऽभि᳘मृशति॥  \n(त्या) आस्मा᳘को ऽसी᳘ति स्व᳘ ऽइव᳘ ह्यस्यैत…",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_03/mula","3.3.4.29","मृशति","ता᳘मभि᳘मृशति॥  \nव्व᳘रुणस्य ऽऋतस᳘दन्यसीत्य᳘थ कृष्णाजिनमा᳘स…",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_03/mula","3.5.3.25","मृशति","…य᳘जमानं वा ग्राहो न᳘ विन्दति तन्नि᳘ष्ठितमभि᳘मृशति व्वैष्णव᳘मसी᳘ति व्वैष्णवᳫँ᳭ हि᳘ हविर्द्धा᳘नम…",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_03/mula","3.6.1.26","मृशति","…᳘र्व्वमे᳘वान्तर्व्वेदि᳘ स्यात्तन्नि᳘ष्ठितमभि᳘मृशति व्वैश्वदेव᳘मसी᳘ति द्वये᳘नैत᳘द्वैश्वदेवं य᳘दस…",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_03/mula","3.9.4.12","मृशति","त᳘मभि᳘मृशति॥  \nय᳘त्ते सोम दिवि ज्यो᳘तिर्य᳘त्पृथिव्यां य᳘…",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_03/mula","3.9.4.13","मृशति","…स्न᳘ एव᳘ देवा᳘नाᳫँ᳭ हवि᳘र्भवति त᳘स्मादेव᳘मभि᳘मृशति॥",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_04/mula","4.2.3.15","मृशति","…ां त्वे᳘ति सादयति पु᳘नर्हविरसी᳘ति स्थाली᳘मभि᳘मृशति॥",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_04/mula","4.2.3.16","मृशति","…ाय त्वे᳘ति सादयति पु᳘नर्हविरसी᳘ति स्थाली᳘मभि᳘मृशति॥",""]]},"Lat.02":{"n":3,"e":[["darshana/vedanta/dvaita/SarvaMula/itihasa_purana_tatparya_nirnaya/bhagavata_tatparya_nirnaya/mula","BTN_C10_S96_V22","मृशन्ति","…दिमतिश्रमेण ज्ञात्वा परेशं मुनयो विमुक्ताः ।\nमृशन्ति यज्ञैश्च यजन्ति नित्यं उपासते वेदफलप्रदं तम्…",""],["darshana/vedanta/dvaita/DvaitaVedanta/purana_prasthana/bhagavata_tatparya_nirnaya/tika_satyadharmiya","DV_11529","मृशन्ति","…दिमतिश्रमेण ज्ञात्वा परेशं मुनयो विमुक्ताः । मृशन्ति यज्ञैश्च यजन्ति नित्यं उपासते वेदफलप्रदं तमि…",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_08/mula","8.1.4.7","मृशन्ति","…]]॥  \nसं᳘चितᳫँ᳭ है᳘के समञ्चनप्रसारणेने᳘त्यभि᳘मृशन्ति पशु᳘रेष यदग्निर्यदा[[!!]] वै᳘ पशुर᳘ङ्गानि सं…",""]]},"krt:lyuw":{"n":1,"e":[["agama/vaishnava_agama/pancharatra/pancharatra_samhitas/pramukha_samhitas/padma_samhita","charya_adhyaya06#23","मर्शनम्","…ा । अर्घ्यं पाद्यं प्रतिग्राहः पाद्यप्लोताभि मर्शनम्",""]]},"VidhiLin.00":{"n":2,"e":[["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_03/mula","3.8.3.36","मृशेत्","…श᳘ङ्कमानो य᳘द्यु विमाथान्न श᳘ङ्केता᳘त्रैव सं᳘मृशेत्॥",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_04/mula","4.5.7.8","मृशेत्","(त्य᳘) अ᳘थो ऽअ᳘भ्येव᳘ मृशेत्॥  \n(द्दे) देवान्दि᳘वमगन्यज्ञस्त᳘तो मा द्र᳘वि…",""]]},"Lot.10":{"n":1,"e":[["vedanga/nirukta/mula","adhyaya_03","मृश","…्,.अर्भकम्.अवहृतम्.भवति/[३२४] ``उप.उप.मे.परा.मृश.मा.मे.दभ्रानि.मन्यथाह्/ऽऽ.``.नमो.महद्भ्यो.नम…",""]]}}}